tional raw-coordinate requirement that each raw update multiplier vanish, one may take \\\\(\\\\delta_n=o(n^{-1})\\\\).\\n- The obstruction is therefore finite numerical state dimension, not a finite number of infinite-dimensional fields.\\n\\nThe complete self-contained proof is here:\\n\\n[Joint deep-linear theorem and proof](/home/amir/Codes/PDE/studies/mean_field_peeling/temporary_deep_linear_joint_audit/JOINT_DEEP_LINEAR_THEOREM.md)\\n\\nFinal audited SHA-256:\\n\\n`ca3407d83f19faa857307c976d680b4c5b97f90901fd5faf48920d2f9e20d799`\\n\\nThree final isolated audits of that exact hash returned clean: algebra/no-go, Gaussian/Fock/source identification, and compact-time exact-GD convergence. The audit record is here:\\n\\n[Audit record](/home/amir/Codes/PDE/studies/mean_field_peeling/temporary_deep_linear_joint_audit/AUDIT_RECORD.md)\\n\\nAlthough the previously cited [Xiang–Zhang theorem](https://arxiv.org/html/2608.04824v1#S3) and its dependencies were checked in full, the final proof does not depend on them: the required Gaussian-word convergence is proved directly from Wick pairings, Gaussian concentration, and a finite-net operator-norm estimate.\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}]},{\"id\":\"01a048cd-ad23-70f2-88bf-b1c2fd61fad0\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"error\":null,\"startedAt\":1787927833,\"completedAt\":1787932349,\"durationMs\":4515989,\"items\":[{\"type\":\"userMessage\",\"id\":\"item-1892\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"can you go back and scrutinize and audit the L=2 single sample design that was proven to have a joint mean field continuous time / gradient flow limit , fully independent and adversarial audits, seeing if passes rigorous and validity tests. if issues come up you can fix, fix them and pass it through the same strict and rigorous and independent audits, do this enough times so that the final super strict and rigorous and independent and adversarial test with isolated independent diversified agents pass. your audits MUST include v